tegory_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","review_id":"cCrCme65YJEoxE4bpf7zgA","date":"2021-04-03T13:40:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9595794677734375,"text_excerpt":"I love the vibe of this place, the drinks, and the food. We got the Vintage cocktail which was very strong and delicious, the fancy beignets (s'mores, pear and brie, and raspberry), and the whipped brie with beignet bites. You *have* to try the fancy beignets. They're absolutely delicious and unique. They're the best beignets in the city by far. The beignet bites with whipped brie was a special, but I hope they make this part of their regular menu. This is a great place to go for happy hour and we will definitely be back!"},{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","review_id":"TAodSFqD1oTZ_vPXEUsWaA","date":"2019-10-04T06:12:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9515595436096191,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely love the atmosphere of this place, as there was an outside area while the weather was nice. I would say the matcha and raspberry beignets were pretty delicious and came out piping hot with the filling oozing our ever so beautifully. I love the crawfish beignets as well! As I think that was my absolute favorite! It was very savory but also sweet at the same time. I liked how they also provided all kinds of different drinks and cafe au lattes. Definitely coming back to try out other items on the menu."},{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","review_id":"zchH2gFdwRbZX6C0erCrsA","date":"2018-08-13T20:12:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.948705792427063,"text_excerpt":"Such a cute cozy space! Walked in during happy hour and sat straight at the bar. We were greeted by a friendly barista that took care of us. I ordered white wine ($5) and fries ($5) from the HH menu. The fries were slightly oily but still tasty nonetheless. I also ordered the beignet flight, which came with the set flavors of matcha green tea, s'mores, and raspberry. The barista told me I was able to substitute different flavors if I wanted to, but I stuck to the selected flavors. My favorite was the s'mores beignet! These fancy beignets are really a unique twist compared to New Orleans traditional beignets. I was actually surprised how delicious they were. They were nice, warm, toasty, a..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","photo_id":"xU_H7FwMUB4Di_3SDQxKKg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xU_H7FwMUB4Di_3SDQxKKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9069084525108337},{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","photo_id":"IPdnFz4SlAosYa_kyCbvqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IPdnFz4SlAosYa_kyCbvqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8966962099075317},{"business_id":"MyFC2F-5SXwXTLR99UWiqA","photo_id":"_OpvFru3e_7mST7Yggxpyw","label":"o